  "description": "IGEWIE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C103 H78 F8 Gd8 N32 O36,12(C1 H4 O1),3(C1 H2 Cl2),3.25(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd7 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd8 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 8 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.942-4.070 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.88-115.91°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C118H138.5Cl6F8Gd8N32O51.25. Article name explicitly identifies I(II).",
